{"id":"d81b1b2123168018","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-language.md","title":"Language","display":"df-language — Language","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-language","aliases":["58-df-language"],"display":"df-language — Language","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language — Language"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}_S\\)</span> (first-order-language predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>一参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 使用结构/满足关系采用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\">\\(\\langle R,F,C,\\operatorname{ar}\\rangle\\)</span> 编码；五参数形式继续使用本文件原有的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle F,R,C,a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle F,R,C,a\\rangle\\)</span> 编码，二者不直接混用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language} \\vdash \\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)\\leftrightarrow (\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cap\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}})\\cup(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cap\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}})\\cup(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\cap\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}})=\\varnothing\\land \\operatorname{Function}\\!\\left(a,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},\\omega\\right)\\land \\forall c\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}\\;a(c)=0\\land \\forall f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\;0&lt;a(f)\\land \\mathcal L=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language} \\vdash \\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a)\\leftrightarrow (\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cap\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}})\\cup(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cap\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}})\\cup(\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\cap\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}})=\\varnothing\\land \\operatorname{Function}\\!\\left(a,\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}}\\cup\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},\\omega\\right)\\land \\forall c\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}}\\;a(c)=0\\land \\forall f\\in\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}}\\;0&lt;a(f)\\land \\mathcal L=\\langle\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{fn}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{rel}},\\Sigma_{\\mathrm{const}},a\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Language}_S(\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A first-order language is determined by its nonlogical symbols and arities.</li>\n<li>Constants are represented as distinguished nullary symbols; positive-arity function symbols are kept disjoint from them.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (functi